  protoOf(WhatsNewWeb).g5l = function () {
    return this.w1n("<!--\nWhat's new on the web. Shown once on my.oxygon.app, on the first visit after a web deploy that changed something.\n\nEvery web deploy that adds or fixes something visible on the web adds a section at the top, in the commit it deploys.\nThe heading is `##` plus the web deploy number, then a `date:` line, then 2 to 5 items.\nAn item is an icon key the web dialog draws (whats-new.js ICONS), a bold title of at most four words, and one plain line of at most 90 characters.\nUser-facing words only. No build numbers, no lane codes, no internal names.\nNever shown inside the iPhone or Android app's web pages; the app has its own What's New (whats-new-in-app.md).\n-->\n\n## 78\ndate: 28 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Live telemetry**\n  Swap the tiles, see the drift line, and expand the route.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Yoga and sauna**\n  Community shows the heart-rate chart and the day card.\n\n- icon: pencil\n  **Copy a note**\n  Right-click a calendar note to copy or paste it.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Solid share cards**\n  A saved share picture keeps a solid background.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Not recorded**\n  A run with no distance says Not recorded, not 0.00 km.\n\n## 77\ndate: 28 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: bicycle\n  **Ride stories**\n  Rides share Effort fingerprint, Ridges and Sound.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Not recorded**\n  A run with no distance reads Not recorded.\n\n## 76\ndate: 28 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Live incline**\n  Incline waits on the chart below 50 m.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Chart menu**\n  Letting go after a hold keeps the menu open.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Body**\n  A wellness day shows the body strip and reader.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Chart labels**\n  Energy and heart-rate captions stay apart.\n\n- icon: bicycle\n  **Heart rate**\n  Choosing bpm again keeps the step's band.\n\n## 75\ndate: 28 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: flame\n  **Planned load**\n  Planned workouts use a more accurate load.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **From your history**\n  Recent sessions of the same kind set the scale.\n\n## 74\ndate: 28 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: bicycle\n  **Ride heart rate**\n  A ride step can target 120\u2013130 bpm.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Swim heart rate**\n  A swim step can target 120\u2013130 bpm.\n\n## 73\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Live drift**\n  The live heart-rate chart draws the drift line.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Drift picture**\n  A finished run can share its drift as a picture.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Heart-rate target**\n  A step can target 120\u2013130 bpm.\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Recorded only**\n  Share sends activities you record in Oxygon.\n\n- icon: flame\n  **Learned effort**\n  Planned load learns heart rate from recent steady sessions.\n\n## 72\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Drift**\n  Warm-up, cool-down, the trend line, and the rep dots.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Yoga filter**\n  Yoga sits with the other sports.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Planned load**\n  The week follows step targets and recent training.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Drift story**\n  A finished run can share its drift.\n\n## 71\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: flame\n  **Fuel temperature**\n  Set it by hand, or fetch the forecast for that start.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Pace tools**\n  Favorites, a split chart, and a third Critical Speed trial.\n\n## 70\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: pencil\n  **Edit activity**\n  A Community post opens it, including sauna, yoga and strength.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **One baseline**\n  Tile titles stay on one line, so the values line up.\n\n## 69\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **This week's plan**\n  The current week compares its whole plan with the week before.\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Past week**\n  A past week reads \"vs the week before\".\n\n## 68\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Lactate tag**\n  Lactate sits after Intervals, and Race stays last.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Share activity**\n  Opens stories, cards, and the 3D video.\n\n## 67\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Finished activity opens**\n  A finished activity opens its page.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Share switches**\n  A finished run shows Community and Strava switches.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Heart-rate chart**\n  A finished sauna shows its heart-rate chart.\n\n## 66\ndate: 27 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Heart-rate chart**\n  A finished sauna or yoga shows its heart-rate chart.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Planned versus before**\n  A future week says planned versus the week before.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Share switches**\n  A finished run has Community and Strava switches.\n\n- icon: flame\n  **Sauna temperature**\n  A finished sauna shows its temperature.\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Clearer share lines**\n  Connected apps says where sharing starts before it is on.\n\n## 65\ndate: 26 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **One Today arrow**\n  The week column has the only Today arrow. The month header has none.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Sorted by plan**\n  Done versus planned lists sports by planned hours, most first.\n\n- icon: pencil\n  **Back to that day**\n  Save or close takes you back to the day you edited, not to today.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **That week compares**\n  That week compares the week on screen with the week before it.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Ask Coach remembers**\n  Ask Coach uses the days you asked about, and follow-ups keep them.\n\n## 64\ndate: 25 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Share sheet stays up**\n  If one card fails, the rest of the share sheet still opens.\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Today has no box**\n  Today is the filled day only, and Body no longer says N/A.\n\n- icon: pencil\n  **Times type normally**\n  Typing a time in Race Predictor keeps every digit you enter.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Charts follow your units**\n  The charts, the 3D video and the share summary follow your km or miles setting.\n\n- icon: flag.checkered\n  **Predictor uses one run**\n  Your best recent run sets every distance. One line names that run.\n\nPredictor uses one run depends on v5 web. This tip already calls that predictor.\n\n## 63\ndate: 25 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **New sticker cards**\n  Share Stats, Route, Splits, Day or a big number as a transparent sticker, or a Map card.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Story video fits**\n  The 3D video fills its card, with a normal heart-rate strip and no Share button inside.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Heart-rate gaps**\n  In the 3D video, a missing heart-rate reading stays a gap instead of dropping to zero.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Share from iPhone**\n  Where the browser cannot share to Strava, it says \"Share it from the iPhone app\".\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Removed posts**\n  A removed post, or one no longer shared with you, says so in plain words.\n\n## 62\ndate: 25 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Roomier share sheet**\n  The share sheet uses one row per line, so it is less cramped.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Swipe between stories**\n  Swipe left for the next story and right for the previous one. The arrow keys work too.\n\n- icon: map\n  **Cleaner Course Planner**\n  An empty course no longer shows placeholder dashes for its time.\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Strava when connected**\n  Connected apps names Strava when your Strava account is connected.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Settings on a phone**\n  Long descriptions in Settings are no longer cut off at phone width.\n\n## 61\ndate: 24 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **No more N/A**\n  Missing figures in lists, lap tables and the planner are left out, never N/A.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Cleaner lap tables**\n  A lap missing a figure leaves its cell empty, and empty columns are hidden.\n\n## 60\ndate: 24 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **Coach knows more**\n  Ask about GAP, cadence, power or zones and get an answer from your own runs.\n\n- icon: map\n  **Quicker long-ride clips**\n  A long ride's replay clip is ready to share much sooner after playback ends.\n\n- icon: list.bullet\n  **Dots that match**\n  Tiles with more than one view show the same side dots on every page.\n\n- icon: pencil\n  **One search ring**\n  Search boxes show a single highlight while you type.\n\n- icon: flag.checkered\n  **Tidier live page**\n  The live page leaves out readings it doesn't have yet, even on small phones.\n\n## 59\ndate: 24 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: map\n  **Faster replay sharing**\n  A replay's clip is ready when it ends, and its four tiles switch with a tap.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Workout as sound**\n  Turn a session into a 15-second piece of music and share it as a video.\n\n- icon: bicycle\n  **Bike pages**\n  Tag bikes road, gravel, mountain, indoor or race; each ride takes the right one.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Live heart rate fits**\n  The live heart rate chart fits your heart rate, from warm-up to the hardest rep.\n\n- icon: checkmark.circle.fill\n  **No more dashes**\n  A reading that doesn't exist is left out instead of showing a dash.\n\n## 58\ndate: 24 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Your profile card**\n  Your streak, latest activity and counts sit beside a wider feed with five tiles.\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Then vs now**\n  Share how a workout compares with last time, or how a run moved your race prediction.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Clearer charts**\n  The m/beat chart shows its run in one compact card, and dates no longer overlap.\n\n- icon: bicycle\n  **Bikes picked for you**\n  A ride with no bike takes yours. A bike you choose by hand always stays.\n\n## 57\ndate: 24 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: square.and.arrow.up\n  **Share as a story**\n  Turn a session into a poster: fingerprint, scorecard, ridge lines, heat bloom, helix.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Charts load once**\n  The Charts page loads each chart once, without redrawing it again and again.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Charts on every post**\n  A run or ride you post from Finish carries its elevation and heart-rate chart.\n\n- icon: flame\n  **Sauna gauge**\n  A sauna post's gauge shows the session's temperature every time it comes on screen.\n\n## 55\ndate: 24 Oct 2026\n\n- icon: bicycle\n  **Planned ride distance**\n  Planned rides show an estimated distance from their steps, in the list and the week.\n\n- icon: chart.xyaxis.line\n  **Charts read right**\n  No line is cut off, and running cadence from your watch reads in steps per minute.\n\n- icon: flame\n  **Sauna thermal load**\n  A sauna shows a Thermal load tile. Tap it to see your heat adaptation.\n\n- icon: map\n  **Longer ride replay**\n  Indoor rides of 60 to 90 km replay on one road, from Tripoli to Kandila via Vytina.\n\n- icon: figure.run\n  **Outdoor runs**\n  A treadmill plan you ran outside with your watch shows as an outdoor run, on road shoes.\n");
  };
